desc: Delete the function arguments
category: motion
par: 5
hint1: There's a text object for "inside parentheses"
hint2: Jump to the paren first, then operate on the inner-bracket text object
solution: f(di(
note: f( jumps to the opening paren; di( deletes everything inside the parentheses
note: (the "inside ()" text object), leaving an empty call().
